Z||000000||Richard Parnell||12-10-1999||03:04 PM||||Is there a way to tell if a tranny (unattached to engined or attached) laying on a shelf in a parts yard is a 5 speed Getrag, just by looking at it or do you need to check some serial number or other?  There's a parts yard here in Honolulu that has a bunch of Fiero six cyl mostly with trans attached.||||reg||1
